{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"aa54bf416b4c6241f3d044488d9306cbbb791cadff35dfad0ef8ade446a7312a","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"f1403b3e60a7cfd6f41e5e7e29577ca63db5276fffd5eb69a1d84080e78b5cb7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f14a476f19489b0f6a79876e7004c6a59a54d9b0e78e967691071d34b66990ed","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"换行不变量：源文在“congratulations!”后是空一行的段落分隔“\\n\\n”，译文“祝贺你！\\n这个等级”只剩一个“\\n”，段落分隔丢失（tome class/Actor.lua:3974，commit 624a6732，Dialog:simpleLongPopup）。另有小问题：“勇敢的向前”应作“勇敢地”。"},{"revision_key":"f1598310a16d9d4f3cccd57260ee7c285f4b5b9ded25f59d80705a6c124adb62","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f15aa79a0c04cf987f73c96cb296ab7b5c19c3d5cd39cd8746a5a02ce502ce9c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f15f5593c718735620a18ddf5948ac4c1b17670950691754aaf89d449e936d16","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制：光辉引力的源文是“all foes in range 5 are drawn to it”。talents/celestial/combat.lua:99-104（624a6732）以被击中目标为中心收集半径5内的敌人，并执行 l.target:pull(target.x,target.y,5)，把他们拉向被击中的目标／光球。译文“将5格范围内的敌人拉过来”容易读成拉向施法者，应明确是拉向被击中的目标。另外，“The strength of your bond is so strong”被译成“你的力量如此强大”，把羁绊之力改成了角色自身的力量；Eyal 被译成“埃亚尔大陆”，但 Eyal 指整个世界（大陆是 Maj'Eyal），这一术语在冻结快照中缺少依据。"},{"revision_key":"f181f499b62e746193ae0ef49fd16d4a14876a82aa7cb034dfe457a3c680c13b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f18f9a4e901a0f5c2e93872aacc75f8e8a9fef72f107cad5788e3bd5c4ee5c8c","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"忠实度偏差（lore/fun.lua:217-289，624a6732）：1）“skeletons are usually armed and sometimes even armoured”被译成“大多都是持有武器或是全副武装的”，把“有时甚至披甲”夸大为“大多全副武装”；2）“treat them as you would a necromancer - with cold steel”被译成“用钢剑刺穿他们的喉咙”，凭空添加了刺喉的内容；3）“Ever fought a snow giant?”被加上源文没有的“一向被视为力量象征的”；4）“all screaming for your blood to be spilt”被改成“因为你的每滴鲜血都令其饥渴无比”，改变了因果关系；5）“I always receive the same answer”被弱化为“几乎都是同样的原因”。"},{"revision_key":"f19cec2641cd74c4c3020f07432b8402ddc8f9efc02c378e785fd4a3668a339f","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义：“I put a bit of the good stuff in this one, though it won't do you any favors tomorrow morning”是说瓶里掺了好酒，明早会让人难受（宿醉）。译文“也许明天早上对你没什么用”把意思译成了“无效”，而且原文没有“也许”；“I put a bit of the good stuff in this one”（往里面加了点好东西）也被改成了“给你带来个好东西”（chats/alchemist-last-hope.lua:405-406，624a6732）。"},{"revision_key":"f1a593dee51a1ce43abda7f3fe4c5636ebb84c51248a0d8247269dd8ac56b275","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f1e389dfae61e9e641ad6118c5b582f3ebbc6ebd99b27bc67e514b415781fe89","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f20e44ef63bf290de8b5b00aaf83cc4009d914cd52d517dd2f94051892ef77e6","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"运行时拼接：%s 由 string.his_her_self(player) 填入，其值是 _t\"himself\"/\"herself\"/\"itself\" 这样的反身代词（engine/utils.lua:953-957，624a6732），不是主语。译文“%s牺牲自己”把 %s 当成主语后又加了“自己”，会显示成“他自己牺牲自己”一类的重复句。该串作为 special_death_msg 被插入 PartyDeath.lua:123-131 的“%s the level %d ... %s on level %s of %s.”，前面已有玩家名作主语。反身代词的译法不在冻结快照内，这一点证据不足。"},{"revision_key":"f22305679ecdc81c0b2ea179ae3a753148e5fbfa642c29acd3be9976241fd18c","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制／伤害类型：剧毒弹的源文是“%0.2f nature damage”。munitions.lua:418 使用 damDesc(self, DamageType.NATURE, poison)，munitions.lua:188 施加 EFF_LEECHING_POISON；timed_effects/physical.lua:3950 说明该效果“doing %0.2f nature damage per turn”（624a6732）。译文写“毒素伤害”，伤害类型错了，应为自然伤害。"},{"revision_key":"f22e755ae07250f21aa228f6719c2f770cd44886dd3fe988c796370b10e8ddc4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"忠实度：timed_effects/other.lua:857（624a6732）中 SHADOW_VEIL 的 on_gain 飘字源文是“+Assail”（袭击），与 on_lose 的“-Assail”成对。译文“+暗影笼罩”描述的是遮蔽状态，不是 Assail 的意思；对应的“-Assail”条目不在冻结输入内，无法核对两者是否一致。"}]}